{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"一、十有五年，春，季孫行父如晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"二、三月，宋司馬華孫來盟。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"三、夏，曹伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"四、齊人歸公孫敖之喪。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"何以不言來？內辭也。脅我而歸之，筍將而來也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"五、六月辛丑朔，日有食之，鼓用牲于社。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"六、單伯至自齊。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"七、晉郤缺帥師伐蔡，戊申入蔡。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"入不言伐，此其言伐何？至之日也。其日何？至之日也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"八、秋，齊人侵我西鄙。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"九、季孫行父如晉。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"十、冬十有一月，諸侯盟于扈。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"十一、十有二月，齊人來歸子叔姬。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"其言來何？閔之也。此有罪，何閔爾？父母之於子，雖有罪，猶若其不欲服罪然。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"十二、齊侯侵我西鄙，遂伐曹，入其郛。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_111_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_111","textTraditional":"郛者何？恢郭也。入郛書乎？曰不書。入郛不書，此何以書？動我也。動我者何？內辭也。其實我動焉爾。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}